{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Let them draw near.</b> The idols." "Now the sense of <b>draw near [your dispute, etc.]</b> [is directed] at Israel, for they did not believe, and they also worshipped idols in Babylonia. And the sense of \"your dispute\" [is]: until it becomes apparent which is good."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:26.609680905Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}